OL,3,GNEWSATrains cancelled and road warnings
OL,4,Aas Storm Boelo sweeps into Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain and ferry services have been
OL,7,Fcancelled and police have warned
OL,8,Fagainst unnecessary road journeys as
OL,9,FStorm Boelo brings heavy rain and
OL,10,Fstrong winds to Scotland.
OL,12,FAn amber Met Office weather warning
OL,13,Fcame into effect at 21:00 on Saturday,
OL,14,Fcovering the mainland and Western Isles
OL,15,Funtil 21:00 on Sunday.
OL,17,FGusts of up to 80mph are forecast as
OL,18,Fthe second named storm in two days hits
OL,19,Fthe country.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
